Description: Per-process egress firewall for Linux with UI prompts
 Fiwu intercepts outgoing network connections via NFQUEUE and
 prompts the user to allow or block each process on first contact.
 Supports permanent and session-only decisions with a tkinter GUI
 and a GNOME shell extension for quick enable/disable from the
 system menu.